        ["I was planning on wandering up and down the landscape, bugging people to see if they had mindblowingly dangerous quests for me to undertake!"] = "¡Estaba planeando vagar arriba y abajo por el paisaje, molestando a la gente para ver si tenían misiones increíblemente peligrosas que yo pudiera emprender!",
