    ["Yes, thankfully I had a compass with me, so I could draw circles with a pencil."] = "Sí, afortunadamente tenía una brújula conmigo, así podía dibujar círculos con un lápiz.",
    ["*(Dialogue 18:)*"] = "*(Diálogo 18 :)*",
    ["I helped out a farmer once. He said he's got 68 sheep and asked if I could round them up for him. I said sure..."] = "Una vez ayudé a un granjero. Dijo que tiene 68 ovejas y me preguntó si podía reunirlas para él. dije seguro...",
    ["*(Dialogue 19:)*"] = "*(Diálogo 19 :)*",
